cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Reinstate"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Rana"
    given-names: "Harjot Singh"
    alias: "HarjjotSinghh"
    website: "https://harjot.co"
repository-code: "https://github.com/HarjjotSinghh/reinstate"
url: "https://github.com/HarjjotSinghh/reinstate"
abstract: >-
  Reinstate is a local-first CLI that indexes and resumes coding-agent sessions
  on one device and syncs supported Claude Code and Codex sessions across
  devices with end-to-end encryption and bring-your-own R2/S3-compatible
  storage. Native resume stays same-vendor, and known credential artifacts are
  excluded by default; session content still requires review because it can
  contain sensitive text.
keywords:
  - ai-coding-agents
  - session-sync
  - claude-code
  - codex
  - encryption
  - developer-tools
license: Apache-2.0
